cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below, together with the accompanying paper."
title: "sumsbkz-py: lattice sieving and descent for equal sums of like powers"
abstract: >-
  Code, run outputs, paper source and data archive for the paper "New records for equal
  sums of like powers via lattice sieving". The search sieves the lattice of integer
  relations among 1^k, ..., N^k with the General Sieve Kernel and uses the sieve database as
  the move set of a greedy descent on the numbers of terms. The repository includes a Python
  port of SumsBKZ (2000-2003), the record databases of 2001-2003, and a standalone verifier
  for the new identities.
type: software
